The 33-day Total Consecration method and Act of Consecration follow
St. Louis-Marie Grignion de Montfort’s *True Devotion to the Blessed Virgin*.
The traditional prayers included here (Ave Maria, Veni Creator, litanies,
and the rest) are in the public domain.

App name, parchment palette, feast calendar, prayer tracker, and accounts
wiring were generated in conversation with Grok.
